--- !u!114 &1497720415
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1497720412}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b><color=#FFD633>CATCH A SEAL \u2014 TUTORIAL</color></b>\n<size=26><color=#AEBBCB>This is a placeholder panel. Replace this text with your own tutorial whenever you are ready.</color></size>\n\n<b><color=#7FD1FF>HOW TO PLAY</color></b>\n\u2022 Move the seal left and right to line up with the falling items.\n\u2022 Catch good items to earn points and build your score.\n\u2022 Dodge bad items \u2014 every one you touch costs health.\n\u2022 Missing a good item also costs health, so stay under the falling objects!\n\u2022 Golden coins are rare. Catch them to earn permanent coins.\n\n<b><color=#7FD1FF>HEALTH</color></b>\nYou start with a limited amount of health. The health bar in the top-left shows how much you have left. When it reaches zero, the run ends and the game over screen appears.\n\n<b><color=#7FD1FF>SCORE MILESTONES</color></b>\nEvery 20 points you reach a new milestone and earn coins:\n\u2022 20 points  \u2192  +10 coins\n\u2022 40 points  \u2192  +30 coins\n\u2022 60 points  \u2192  +70 coins\n\u2022 80 points  \u2192  +150 coins\n\u2022 100 points \u2192  +310 coins\nThe reward keeps growing, so the longer you survive the more coins you collect.\n\n<b><color=#7FD1FF>COINS</color></b>\nCoins are shared across the whole game. They are saved automatically, so you can spend them in the Potion Bar later.\n\n<b><color=#7FD1FF>PAUSE MENU</color></b>\nPress the PAUSE button in the bottom-left corner (or the Escape key) at any time to open the pause menu. From there you can restart the run, return to this main menu, or visit the Potion Bar.\n\n<b><color=#7FD1FF>TIPS</color></b>\n\u2022 Watch the whole screen, not just the seal.\n\u2022 The game speeds up as your score climbs.\n\u2022 Coins are worth chasing, but do not risk your last bit of health for one.\n\u2022 Your best score is saved on this device.\n\n<size=26><color=#AEBBCB>Scroll with the mouse wheel, drag the scrollbar, or drag the text. Click anywhere or press Escape to return to the main menu.</color></size>\n\nThis extra space is here so you can test scrolling. Replace it with more tutorial pages, controls, or artwork notes.\n\n\n<b><color=#FFD633>THANKS FOR PLAYING!</color></b>"
